Lines 12-14: handleNavigate

const handleNavigate = (page) => {
  navigate(PAGE_PATHS[page] || '/')
}
Idhu dhaan translator 🗣️. Pages-kitta kudukkura pudhu "phone number" idhu dhaan.

Step by step, handleNavigate('out') call aana:
1. page = 'out'
2. PAGE_PATHS['out'] → '/out'
3. navigate('/out') → URL maarudhu ✅

|| '/' enna? "Illana" nu artham. Table-la illaadha name vandha (e.g., typo 'outt'), PAGE_PATHS['outt'] → undefined. Appo undefined || '/' → '/', so Home-ku pogum. App crash aagaama irukka oru safety net 🥅

